{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43366","headline":"刺安南事诗 · 懿宗朝举子","name":"刺安南事诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南荒不择吏，致我交趾覆。\n联绵三四年，致我交趾辱。\n儒者鬬则退，武者兵益黩。\n军容满天下，战将多金玉。\n刮得齐民疮，分爲猛士禄。\n雄雄许昌师，忠武冠其族。\n去爲万骑风，住爲一川肉。\n时有残卒回，千门万户哭。\n哀声动闾里，怨气成山谷。\n谁能听鼓声，不忍看金镞。\n念此堪泪流，悠悠颍川绿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"懿宗朝举子","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43366.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43366","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}